* (**88.8%** — surged from 7,800 to 8,879!)\n  - **SEO Metadata:** **562 / 1,000** (56.2% — actively executing in parallel across Stage 3)\n  - **Audio Rule Compliance:** **2,559 video prompts** (100% compliant with `\"Audio: no human voice, only cinematic BGM.\"`)\n  - **Packaged MP4 Files:** **217 files** (218 package folders)\n  - **Database File:** `/home/azureuser/.openclaw/workspace/IROSCRIPT-CEO/social-media/youtube/Youtube Automation/PromptDatabase/database/youtube_pipeline.db` (41.4 MB, healthy, WAL mode, 0 locks).\n- **Recent Master CSV Exports & Direct Download Links:**\n  - 09:00 AM BST: [paste.rs/Nw5vZ](https://paste.rs/Nw5vZ) | Dashboard: [tmpfiles.org/dl/wEwRErxpVO7c](https://tmpfiles.org/dl/wEwRErxpVO7c/master_dashboard_26_sept_03.00_am.csv) | Prompts: [tmpfiles.org/dl/wkweEVxoVKO8](https://tmpfiles.org/dl/wkweEVxoVKO8/master_prompts_from_db_26_sept_03.00_am.csv)\n  - 08:30 AM BST: [paste.rs/HGtCz](https://paste.rs/HGtCz) | Dashboard: [tmpfiles.org/dl/wwwAE7NBBtQM](https://tmpfiles.org/dl/wwwAE7NBBtQM/master_dashboard_26_sept_02.30_am.csv) | Prompts: [tmpfiles.org/dl/wkwjE2NpBeBQ](https://tmpfiles.org/dl/wkwjE2NpBeBQ/master_prompts_from_db_26_sept_02.30_am.csv)\n  - 08:00 AM BST: [paste.rs/l3GFF](https://paste.rs/l3GFF) | Dashboard: [tmpfiles.org/dl/wVwrEWNS7SL0](https://tmpfiles.org/dl/wVwrEWNS7SL0/master_dashboard_26_sept_02.00_am.csv) | Prompts: [tmpfiles.org/dl/w6wREyNy7JXd](https://tmpfiles.org/dl/w6wREyNy7JXd/master_prompts_from_db_26_sept_02.00_am.csv)\n  - 07:30 AM BST: [paste.rs/yoDXx](https://paste.rs/yoDXx) | Dashboard: [tmpfiles.org/dl/w7w6E3qMk74q](https://tmpfiles.org/dl/w7w6E3qMk74q/master_dashboard_26_sept_01.30_am.csv) | Prompts: [tmpfiles.org/dl/w4wHEqqTkvpU](https://tmpfiles.org/dl/w4wHEqqTkvpU/master_prompts_from_db_26_sept_01.30_am.csv)\n  - 07:00 AM BST: [paste.rs/RUJsz](https://paste.rs/RUJsz) | Dashboard: [tmpfiles.org/dl/w9wSEvqp7t3e](https://tmpfiles.org/dl/w9wSEvqp7t3e/master_dashboard_26_sept_01.00_am.csv) | Prompts: [tmpfiles.org/dl/wTwwEfqx7qik](https://tmpfiles.org/dl/wTwwEfqx7qik/master_prompts_from_db_26_sept_01.00_am.csv)\n  - 06:30 AM BST: [paste.rs/beiBb](https://paste.rs/beiBb) | Dashboard: [tmpfiles.org/dl/wfwtEOPdqg5m](https://tmpfiles.org/dl/wfwtEOPdqg5m/master_dashboard_26_sept_12.30_am.csv) | Prompts: [tmpfiles.org/dl/wSwhEyPeqHtS](https://tmpfiles.org/dl/wSwhEyPeqHtS/master_prompts_from_db_26_sept_12.30_am.csv)\n  - 06:00 AM BST: [paste.rs/WsT2N](https://paste.rs/WsT2N) | Dashboard: [tmpfiles.org/dl/wDwvE2PyaqMr](https://tmpfiles.org/dl/wDwvE2PyaqMr/master_dashboard_26_sept_12.00_am.csv) | Prompts: [tmpfiles.org/dl/w3wcEDPlap0Q](https://tmpfiles.org/dl/w3wcEDPlap0Q/master_prompts_from_db_26_sept_12.00_am.csv)\n\n---\n\n### 3. Key Findings & Resolved Incidents\n1. **Database Schema Constraints & Concurrency Lock Resolution:**\n   - Problem: Inserting ideas caused `NOT NULL constraint failed: ideas.raw_idea`, and SEO queries had mismatched column names (`default_language` instead of `language`, missing `status`, extra columns in `seo_keyword_metrics`). Unhandled exceptions left transactions open, causing `database is locked`.\n   - Resolution: \n     - Fixed all schema column alignments in `do_insert_ideas`, `do_insert_prompts`, and `do_insert_seo`.\n     - In `execute_db_write(write_fn)`, wrapped writes in `with db_write_lock:`, `conn.execute(\"BEGIN IMMEDIATE;\")`, and `finally: conn.close()`.\n     - Tested via dry-run transaction rollback: zero locks have occurred since.\n2. **Escalation Prompt Parsing Unlocked (`parse_json_from_text`):**\n   - Problem: ChatGPT outputs unescaped double quotes inside HUD text (e.g. `\"STEP 1: LAUNCH\"`), which caused standard `json.loads` to throw `Expecting ',' delimiter: line 2 column ...`.\n   - Resolution: Enhanced `parse_json_from_text` with `strict=False` and a robust level-by-level regex pattern matcher that extracts `\"1\":` through `\"10\":` independently of inner unescaped quotes or trailing markdown delimiters. This caused the prompt generation rate to surge by +248 to +277 prompts per half hour.\n3. **Container Busy State (429) & CloakBrowser Memory Recovery:**\n   - Problem: The worker FastAPI server returns `429 Too Many Requests` when `is_busy` is `True`. When heavy DOM / JS accumulates over hundreds of continuous queries, Chromium tabs crash or hang during polling.\n   - Resolution: Periodically restarting the 4 worker containers (`sg docker -c \"docker restart chatgpt_worker_1 chatgpt_worker_2 chatgpt_worker_3 chatgpt_worker_4\"`) flushes Chromium memory. CloakBrowser auto-solves Cloudflare Turnstile on boot and verifies session in ~15-20s without losing authentication.\n\n---\n\n### 4. Active Context\n- **Active Background Cron Task:** `task-9328` (Recurring cron: `0,30 * * * *`), fires every 30 minutes.\n- **Active Orchestrator Process:** `task-11079` (`python3 Youtube Automation/PromptDatabase/run_cluster_pipeline.py`).\n- **Cluster Workers State:**\n  - Worker 1 (Md Shapon, 8001): Elements 22 to 41, Cycle #3 (6/10 tasks), active.\n  - Worker 2 (Gaming Dot Bangla, 8002): Elements 42 to 61, Cycle #3 (6/7 tasks), active.\n  - Worker 3 (Irak Iroan AI, 8003): Elements 62 to 81, Cycle #5 (6/6 tasks done), active generating SEO.\n  - Worker 4 (Alco Store, 8004): Elements 82 to 100, Cycle #1 (4 tasks), active.\n- **Current Reporting File State:**\n  - `TS = \"26_sept_03.30_am\"` is already set in `Youtube Automation/PromptDatabase/generate_all_csvs.py`.\n\n---\n\n### 5. Next Steps (In Priority Order)\n1. **Deliver 09:30 AM BST (03:30 UTC) Reporting:**\n   - Run `python3 \"Youtube Automation/PromptDatabase/generate_all_csvs.py\"`.\n   - Upload `master_dashboard_26_sept_03.30_am.csv` and `master_prompts_from_db_26_sept_03.30_am.csv` to `tmpfiles.org`.\n   - Upload the 09:30 AM audit text to `paste.rs`.\n   - Respond to Iraq Bhai in pure Bengali script (`বাংলা লিপি`), addressing him as **\"ইরাক ভাইয়া\"**.\n2. **Monitor Milestone Progress Towards 9,000 Prompts & 900 Ideas:**\n   - Prompts are at 8,879 (88.8%) — on track to cross 9,000 prompts within the next interval.\n   - Ideas are at 847 (84.7%) — on track towards the 1,000 ideas target.\n   - Verify that all 4 workers continue generating without getting stuck on busy loops. If worker containers show prolonged `is_busy`, run `sg docker -c \"docker restart chatgpt_worker_1 chatgpt_worker_2 chatgpt_worker_3 chatgpt_worker_4\"`.\n3. **Monitor Next Half-Hour Interval (10:00 AM BST / 04:00 UTC):**\n   - The recurring cron `task-9328` will fire at `04:00:00Z`. Keep the exact half-hour reporting cadence.\n\n---\n\n### 6. Commitments & Constraints\n- Always address the user as **\"ইরাক ভাইয়া\"** in pure Bengali script (`বাংলা লিপি`), zero Banglish.\n- Maintain the Two-Tier Timing Architecture (Micro: 5-10 processes, 2-20m rest, +10s ladder; Macro: 2-4h work, 1-2h deep rest).\n- Strictly enforce locked audio rule: `\"Audio: no human voice, only cinematic BGM.\"` on all video prompts.\n- Zero autonomous deletion or modification of database rows, git files, or packaged MP4s.\n- Strictly isolated inside `/home/azureuser/.openclaw/workspace/IROSCRIPT-CEO/social-media/youtube`.\n</summary>\n\n# Running Background Tasks\nThe following background tasks were running at the time this checkpoint was created.\nUse the manage_task tool to interact with them (e.g. to kill them or check their status).\n\n{\n  \"taskId\":  \"e1e03563-8d0d-414d-8b7e-5b8cfbbda523/task-9328\",\n  \"toolName\":  \"schedule\",\n  \"toolSummary\":  \"Schedule half-hour cron\",\n  \"description\":  \"Cron: 0,30 * * * *, Prompt: Clock half-hour reached (:00 or :30). Check pipeline progress across all 4 workers and report status to Iraq bhai\",\n  \"startTime\":  \"2026-09-25T07:33:11.896114741Z\",\n  \"stepIndex\":  9328,\n  \"logUri\":  \"file:///home/azureuser/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/e1e03563-8d0d-414d-8b7e-5b8cfbbda523/.system_generated/tasks/task-9328.log\"\n}\n{\n  \"taskId\":  \"e1e03563-8d0d-414d-8b7e-5b8cfbbda523/task-11079\",\n